 'At the Customers request, we provide an engraving service on the inner wall of a chess box or a chess field. The best square for engraving is A1 or H8. We engrave inscriptions, logos, etc. from Your project. Some sets, due to the profiling of the chess boxes, allow for engraving only on the chess field (eg CH104 chess set). The maximum size of the chess box on which we can engrave is 60 cm. The pictorial photo shows an example of an inscription made on a chess box of the Ambassador chess set (symbol CH128). To order an engraving, just add it to the basket as a regular product and in the comments to the order, send the exact content that should be engraved on chess. If the engraving was to be made in several places, e.g. on 2 different inner edges and a chess field, for each place, an engraving service should be purchased separately (in this case, we add 3x Chess engraving to the basket). We only accept payment in advance for engraved products. ATTENTION!!!'),
