(100, 'szachowo:4', 'For Three Players Chess Set – Large', 'three-player-sets', 'sunrise-chess-games', 91.00, 24, 3, 1.3, 27.0, 5.0, 47.0,
 '{"king_height_mm": 85, "pieces_material": "hornbeam, beech", "board_material": "beech, birch", "dimensions": "270x470x50 mm", "ean": "5902560350623", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CH162", "variant_group": "szachowo:three-player-sets-for-three-players-chess-set-large", "variant": {"Colour": "Natural"}}',
 'Bored with standard chess? Want to try new challanges? Stand against two armies simultaneously, make allies and roar into the battle! This unique chess set for 3 players constitutes a very interesting alternative to standard chess for two. It is very comfortable in use due to its large size. The set features nicely finished hexagonal case which is provided with compartments covered with felt lining for the chess pieces storage inside. The folding case is available in standard (brown) colour and other colours on request. The chessmen are made from hornbeam and beech wood and have black felt bases. A leaflet with the rules of the game is added to each set.'),
