(174, 'szachowo:82', '"Jupiter"; No. 4 Tournament Wooden Chess Set (42x42cm); burned and weighted', 'folding-sets', 'sunrise-chess-games', 59.00, 0, 5, 1.3, 42.0, 2.5, 42.0,
 '{"king_height_mm": 85, "pieces_material": "hornbeam, sycamore", "board_material": "beech, birch", "dimensions": "42x42x2,5 cm", "ean": "5902560350135", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHW6"}',
 '“JUPITER” No. 4 wooden chess set (42 × 42 cm) – weighted pieces, classic set The “JUPITER” No. 4 wooden chess set is a sturdy set for everyday play at home. Its classic design, clear chessboard and well-balanced pieces make the game comfortable and enjoyable for both beginners and more advanced players. The set includes STAUNTON No. 4 carved wooden pieces Thanks to its universal size of 42 × 42 cm, the set is perfect for the living room table, a desk or when meeting up with friends. Key features wooden construction – durability and a classic look weighted pieces – stability during play felt pads – smooth movement of the pieces burnished chessboard – clear squares and an attractive finish convenient size – comfortable play in all conditions What are they suitable for? The “JUPITER” No. 4 chess set is a good choice for those looking for: a wooden chess set for the home a set for regular play an idea for a versatile gift This is a practical set for anyone who wants to play comfortably without unnecessary extras. Why choose this set? The weighted pieces improve control over movement and prevent accidental toppling.'),
