 'Exclusive chess pieces made of exotic padouk wood with a reddish tint and used to produce decorative elements of the Indian boxwood variety. Adios 4 chess pieces Paduk is a type of wood known for its durability and deep, rich color. The combination of paduk and boxwood creates a contrasting effect, combining a deep shade with subtle delicacy. The set includes additional queen pieces. Adios pieces have been carefully designed, paying attention to the smallest details. The boxwood finish adds delicacy and aesthetics, creating an elegant whole. Each piece in this collection has a unique character thanks to the natural patterns of paduk and boxwood. No set is identical, which makes owning such pieces a unique experience. When you invest in Adios 4" paduk and boxwood chess pieces, you are investing not only in playing tools, but also in a unique piece of art that will highlight the uniqueness of each chess game.'),
(225, 'szachowo:1564', 'Laser engraving', 'chess-accessories', 'sunrise-chess-games', 15.00, 0, 4, 0.56, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "5907311002875", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "ENGRAVING FEAST"}',
 'Upon request, we provide engraving service on the inner wall of the chess case or chess field. If you choose a chess field, please specify on which field the engraving is to be made (engraving on A1 or H8 fields looks best). We engrave inscriptions, logos, graphics, etc. sent by the customer. To order an engraving, just add it to your cart as a regular product and in the comments to the order send the exact content , which is to be engraved on the chess set. Some sets, due to the contoured shape of the chess case, give the possibility to apply the engraving only on the chess field (e.g. CH104). The maximum size of the chess case on which we can make an engraving is 60 cm. The review photo shows an example of an inscription made on a chess case of the Ambassador model (cat. no. CH128). If the engraving was to be made in several places, for example, on 2 different inner edges and the chessboard field, for each place the engraving service must be purchased separately (in this case, we put 3x Chess Engraving in the cart). We accept only payment in advance for engraved products.'),
