(272, 'szachowo:1481', 'DGT Centaur - Chess Computer', 'electronic-boards', 'sunrise-chess-games', 337.00, 34, 4, 2.3, 44.5, NULL, 40.1,
 '{"ean": "8717662821837", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA47"}',
 'This beautifully designed chess board has touch sensors that effortlessly register your moves. It has a rechargeable battery, e-Paper display, intuitive settings in many languages and weighted plastic chess pieces. The computer moves are indicated by unique circular LED lights. Its greatest feature is the adaptive intelligent chess program that automatically adjusts itself to your playing strength so that you will always have a suitable playing partner. Stop using computer screens, tablets or telephones and start playing chess with Centaur on a real board with real chess pieces. Simply turn it on and make your move! Centaur is always there to challenge you, to help develop your game and to keep you sharp! Other chess computers are made to play at the highest strength. They are impossible to beat. At lower levels they play unnatural and unhuman. They are simply no fun to play against. Centaur was made to give everyone a good game. Whether you are a beginner or a strong player, whether you are a home player or a club player, Centaur will adjust to you as soon as you make your first move.'),
(273, 'szachowo:1104', 'DGT Electronic Classic Chess Pieces', 'electronic-boards', 'dgt', 275.00, 49, 4, 1.06, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "5902560354430", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA32"}',
 'DGT electronic classic weighted chess pieces. This is a model with dark Staunton chess pieces coloured in black.'),
(274, 'szachowo:355', 'DGT e-Board Bluetooth Walnut/Maple', 'electronic-boards', 'sunrise-chess-games', 779.00, 36, 4, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821639", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA16A"}',
 'PAY ATTENTION: Only the board, no pieces are included! The wireless version of the DGT e-Boards for individual use was released in 2009 and uses Bluetooth to connect to the computer. The Bluetooth e-Board is available in Rosewood and Walnut and can be used in combination with any of the DGT chess sets: Timeless, Ebony, Royal, Classic, Venus and official FIDE set. Some of the special features of the DGT Wireless e-Board are: Capable of 10+ meters Bluetooth true-wireless communication and approximately 40+ meters successfully tested indoors with high quality dongle USB wired communication (3.5 meter mini-USB cable included) Board houses a Li-Ion battery, rechargeable over USB cable to PC or main adapter giving 24 hours full play Three-colour LED status indicator Increased scanning speed (6 scans/second) Firmware upgrade feature makes it easy to install future software enhancements and new functions DGT3000 and DGT XL clock (optional) functions as display for board instructions You can find more detailed information in the Bluetooth e-Board installation guide (see bottom). Bluetooth e-Board firmware and drivers can be found here .'),
(275, 'szachowo:340', 'DGT e-Board USB Walnut/Maple', 'electronic-boards', 'dgt', 568.00, 35, 3, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821653", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA13"}',
 'The plug & play DGT electronic chess board brings you the best of two worlds. The classical game of chess finaly merged with 21st century computer and internet technology. The beautiful classic wooden DGT e-board easely connects to the USB port on your PC. With the DGT e-board you can play online at internet chess sites like PlayChess, Chess 21 and ICC. The ingenious e-board acts as input device for all major playing programs. The DGT e-board is the ultimate chess-PC interface. It adds a new dimension to your chess fun. A typical DGT product. Innovative, designed for the real chess lover. High quality and value for money. The giftbox comes whit a special edition of the famous Fritz program. DGT Walnut e-Boards do not have indices. Attention: Only the board, no pieces are included! Chess pieces are available separately.'),
(276, 'szachowo:554', 'DGT Serial E-Board Walnut Tournament', 'electronic-boards', 'dgt', 589.00, 45, 3, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821738", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA17"}',
 'PAY ATTENTION: Only the board, no pieces are included! Tournament e-Boards are used at Chess Olympiads, World Chess Championships and all major chess tournaments around the world to show the games live as they happen. Also many smaller tournaments use the boards to show games live on their tournament website. Showing live games attracts more visitors to your website and makes it easier to find sponsors. Free DGT LiveChess software is used to manage the e-Boards and arrange the live transmission of games in real time via the internet or on screens at the playing venue. The boards can be combined with one of the following type e-Board pieces: Royal, Classic, Timeless, Venus, Ebony or FIDE. And last but not least you can also have a DGT3000 clock with the board. Serial Tournament e-Boards are standard supplied in a custom made e-Board storage bag.'),
(277, 'szachowo:343', 'DGT e-Board USB Rosewood/Maple', 'electronic-boards', 'sunrise-chess-games', 601.00, 48, 4, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821646", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA15"}',
 'The plug & play DGT electronic chess board brings you the best of two worlds. The classical game of chess finaly merged with 21st century computer and internet technology. The beautiful classic wooden DGT e-board easely connects to the USB port on your PC. With the DGT e-board you can play online at internet chess sites like PlayChess, Chess 21 and ICC. The ingenious e-board acts as input device for all major playing programs. The DGT e-board is the ultimate chess-PC interface. It adds a new dimension to your chess fun. A typical DGT product. Innovative, designed for the real chess lover. High quality and value for money. The giftbox comes whit a special edition of the famous Fritz program. The USB e-Boards are available in three wood types: Walnut, Wenge and Rosewood. The boards can be combined with one of the following type e-Board pieces: Royal, Classic, Timeless, Venus, Ebony or FIDE. And last but not least you can also have a DGT3000 clock with the board. Attention: Only the e-board, no e-board chess pieces are included! Chess pieces are available separately.'),
(278, 'szachowo:1112', 'DGT Official FIDE set Weighted', 'electronic-boards', 'sunrise-chess-games', 806.00, 3, 4, 1.41, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "5907311000284", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA36W"}',
 'DGT Official FIDE set weighted They were used for the first time during The World Championship Match 2013 in Chennai India between Magnus Carlsen and Vishy Anand. The official set was designed by Daniel Weil, famous architect and designer from Pentagram studio in London. The appearance of pieces connect the tradition with modernity. It is relied on the ancient Greece architecture proportions and immortal Staunton style. The white pieces have been made of boxwood, the black ones instead of precous ebony. Two additional queens are included.'),
(279, 'szachowo:1149', 'DGT Serial E-Board Rosewood/Maple Tournament', 'electronic-boards', 'sunrise-chess-games', 621.00, 6, 4, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821745", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA19"}',
 'This is a high quality electronic chessboard in tournament version (so called serial) which can be connected to other tournament chessboards (to connect 12 e-boards one needs 1 major wire and 11 additional wires). In order to establish online transmission the major wire is required. All accessories to electronic chessboards can be bought separately in our store. The board is inlaid with maple and wenge. It is provided with alphanumeric notation. The set contains: electronic chessboard, bag for board storage, torunament bag for chess pieces storage. The chess pieces can be bought separately in our store.'),
(280, 'szachowo:1107', 'DGT Electronic Ebony Chess Pieces Weighted', 'electronic-boards', 'dgt', 657.00, 0, 5, 2.5, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821783", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA33W"}',
 'DGT Electronic Wegihted Ebony Chess Pieces for electronic DGT boards. The Ebony model is the most exclusive set of electronic chess pieces made of genuine ebony.'),
(281, 'szachowo:1114', 'DGT Electronic Timeless Chess Pieces Weighted', 'electronic-boards', 'dgt', 431.00, 0, 4, 2.5, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821769", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA31W"}',
 'Timeless electronic weighted chess pieces constitute a classical set we know from numerous elite tournaments featuring such stars like Magnus Carlsen, Sergey Karjakin or Levon Aronian. Additional queens are included.'),
(282, 'szachowo:344', 'DGT e-Board Bluetooth Rosewood/Maple', 'electronic-boards', 'dgt', 811.00, 0, 3, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821622", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA16"}',
 'PAY ATTENTION: Only the board, no pieces are included! The wireless version of the DGT e-Boards for individual use was released in 2009 and uses Bluetooth to connect to the computer. The Bluetooth e-Board is available in Rosewood and Walnut and can be used in combination with any of the DGT chess sets: Timeless, Ebony, Royal, Classic, Venus and official FIDE set. Some of the special features of the DGT Wireless e-Board are: Capable of 10+ meters Bluetooth true-wireless communication and approximately 40+ meters successfully tested indoors with high quality dongle USB wired communication (3.5 meter mini-USB cable included) Board houses a Li-Ion battery, rechargeable over USB cable to PC or main adapter giving 24 hours full play Three-colour LED status indicator Increased scanning speed (6 scans/second) Firmware upgrade feature makes it easy to install future software enhancements and new functions DGT3000 and DGT XL clock (optional) functions as display for board instructions You can find more detailed information in the Bluetooth e-Board installation guide (see bottom). Bluetooth e-Board firmware and drivers can be found here .'),
(283, 'szachowo:346', 'DGT e-Board Bluetooth Wenge/Maple', 'electronic-boards', 'sunrise-chess-games', 552.00, 0, 3, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "5907311002769", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA16B"}',
 'PAY ATTENTION: Only the board, no pieces are included!'),
(284, 'szachowo:553', 'DGT e-Board USB Wenge/Maple', 'electronic-boards', 'dgt', 584.00, 0, 5, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821714", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA14"}',
 'The plug & play DGT electronic chess board brings you the best of two worlds. The classical game of chess finaly merged with 21st century computer and internet technology. The beautiful classic wooden DGT e-board easely connects to the USB port on your PC. With the DGT e-board you can play online at internet chess sites like PlayChess, Chess 21 and ICC. The ingenious e-board acts as input device for all major playing programs. The DGT e-board is the ultimate chess-PC interface. It adds a new dimension to your chess fun. A typical DGT product. Innovative, designed for the real chess lover. High quality and value for money. The giftbox comes whit a special edition of the famous Fritz program. The USB e-Boards are available in three wood types: Walnut, Wenge and Rosewood. The boards can be combined with one of the following type e-Board pieces: Royal, Classic, Timeless, Venus, Ebony or FIDE. And last but not least you can also have a DGT3000 clock with the board. Attention: Only the e-board, no e-board chess pieces are included! Chess pieces are available separately.'),
