 'This is a high quality electronic chessboard in tournament version (so called serial) which can be connected to other tournament chessboards (to connect 12 e-boards one needs 1 major wire and 11 additional wires). In order to establish online transmission the major wire is required. All accessories to electronic chessboards can be bought separately in our store. The board is inlaid with maple and rosewood. It is provided with alphanumeric notation. The set contains: electronic chessboard, bag for board storage, torunament bag for chess pieces storage. The chess pieces can be bought separately in our store. Sunrise Chess & Games company is the biggest DGT distributor in this part of Europe. We have warranty service for DGT products.'),
