 'A non-descript tournament chess board finished with walnut and sycamore marquetry, measuring 48x48cm. This chess board has fields of 50x50mm and is ideal for our medium sized 3.5" or Staunton No 5 Figures There are 4 felt pads on the underside of the chess board to ensure smooth movement and stability on a table, desk or other hard and level surface. Chess boards are recognised by FIDE as professional chess boards. Most chess tournaments are held on chess boards with fields ranging from 50 to 58mm, international tournaments nowadays - on electronic boards. The chess board is a professional chess board.'),
