 'Another fabulous chess pieces came from India. The beautifully carved knight piece attracts attention at once. The precision of details of this set corresponds to far more expensive pieces. What makes this model really inimitable is the presence of reins and a bit within the knight''s head. All pieces are made of boxwood, but the black ones were carved so as to resmble the precious ebony (black colourant sinks into the wood at few milimeters depth). The set is very well balanced and when it comes to its finesse and beauty can easily compete with way more expensive models. Two additional queens are included.'),
