 'DGT''s electronic plastic chess pieces are made of high-quality, durable plastic and are additionally weighted. The pieces come with extra hetmans. . Set is tournament size, with a king height of 95 mm. The pieces are designed to be played on DGT''s CHCA39 electronic plastic boards.'),
(458, 'szachowo:926', 'Blackmore Acacia/Boxwood 3,75" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 118.00, 39, 3, 1.1, NULL, NULL, NULL,
