 'Exclusive chess pieces Sultan features very elegant and rich style appreciated all over the world. The sublime knight piece enravishes by its details care. The best indian artisans enriched it with the reins. A trifle inclined head signals the obedience to king’s (sultan’s) commands. The king has quite unusual cross with a little ball on top and its rims are subtly rounded. The upper part of queen seems to be slightly pressed the effect of which however makes it look like a lily flower with its petals floating merrily on the water surface. Very solid and simple rook resembles a fortified tower. The pieces altogether can fight the enemy army not worse than the sultan’s soldiers. Black pieces are made of acacia while the white ones are made of boxwood.'),
