 'If we could draw the whole body of the knight here it sould be a gallopping one. Head slightly inclined, upright ears resembling two sharp corns, tousled mane and opened muzzle suggest it is in racing mood and probably running at the moment. This concept is rather rare among chess pieces that is why it makes this model so special. The whole set is carefully carved and beautiffly polished by skilled indian artisans. The black pieces are made of padauk (Pterocarpus sandalinus) thanks to which their appearence is absolutely fascinating.'),
(479, 'szachowo:944', 'Elvis Knight Ebony 4,25" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 396.00, 50, 4, 2.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "5902560355765", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI122 H425"}',
 'This model commemorates the great Elvis Presley. The chessmen can possibly overshadow the other luxurious models. The silhouette of kight is pure masterpiece. The amount of details stuns especially in the showcase piece which is always a knight. However the king as well has its own particular design which should be mentioned. His cross is perforated in the middle, let alone the other pieces beautifully finished and polished, shining like jewels. The black pieces were made of ebony and their white equivalents of boxwood.'),
(480, 'szachowo:1462', 'Baggio Ebony chess pieces 4''''', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 408.00, 5, 3, 2.7, NULL, NULL, NULL,
