 NULL),
(481, 'szachowo:941', 'Champfered Base Redwood 4,25" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 343.00, 10, 4, 2.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"pieces_material": "Padauk/Boxwood", "ean": "5902560353891", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI121 RED425"}',
 'What strikes at first glance is the structure of king which makes it similar to the CHI119 model because of the presence of the special irregular cross on its top. The knight piece is very solid and perfectly carved. Very caracteristic is bishop’s notch which is placed vertically not obliquely which is the most common solution in other chessmen models. The black pieces are made of padauk (Pterocarpus sandalinus) thanks to which their appearence is absolutely fascinating.'),
(482, 'szachowo:946', 'Made In America Knight Redwood 4" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 409.00, 3, 4, 1.5, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 101, "pieces_material": "Padauk/Boxwood", "ean": "5902560353853", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI123 RED400"}',
 'The present model stands out from the others due to its innovative rook design. The artisans gave up the crenelation on top of it and replaced it by a solid homogeneous fortified tower with a little ball on top. All pieces are really particular, but let us mention the most distinctive ones which are in this case a knight and a king. The last one is definitely unique on account of his cross design which has a tiny hollow circle in the middle. On the other hand, the knight seems proud and solid with its serrated mane. All that makes the design of this set second to none. This interesting model of Staunton chess pieces was surprisingly made in India not America. It is worth underlining the particular colour of pieces which they owe to a specific wood. The black pieces were made of padauk (Pterocarpus sandalinus) while their white equivalents are of boxwood. The chess pieces have been carved very precisely. The care about details strikes at first glance. The height of king amounts to 4 inches which equals to 10,1 cm.'),
(483, 'szachowo:928', 'Pershing Ebony 4,25" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 498.00, 7, 5, 2.2, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 108, "pieces_material": "boxwood/ebony", "ean": "5902560353938", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI114 E425"}',
 'The particular care and design of chessmen should appeal to every royal game connoisseur. The cross on top of the most important chess piece is very little compared to the entire king piece. The bishop has an unusually wide notch no top while the mane of knight seems to be jagged creating an illusion of its rage. Altogether the pieces look remarkably well. Black pieces are made of ebony while the white ones are made of boxwood.'),
(484, 'szachowo:929', 'Unicorn Ebony 4,25" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 409.00, 10, 5, 2.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 110, "ean": "5902560353921", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI115 E425"}',
 'Another beautiful model from Staunton luxurious pieces collection. One cannot stand indifferently looking on the knight of this model which resembles rather a majestic lion than an ordinary stallion. Compared to other models, this one features marvelously carved knight eyes. They seem to be extremly inteligent and look defiantly at the enemy without any sign of fear. Carefully arranged mane along with the upright ears and a slightly open muzzle make this piece one of the most beautiful at all. Black pieces were made of precious ebony while the white ones on boxwood.'),
(485, 'szachowo:377', 'Zagreb Chess Figures Indian Acacia/ Boxwood 3,75 inch Carved Wooden Figures', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 92.00, 0, 5, 1.42, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 95, "pieces_material": "Acacia/Boxwood", "ean": "5902560350432", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI103 S375"}',
 'In the 50''s and 60''s of the twentieth century Chess Set "Zagreb" was one of the most popular chess sets that was used in the most important chess tournaments around the world, among others, in Candidates Tournament which took place in 1959, in three cities belonging toYugoslavia - Bled, Belgrade and Zagreb. This beautiful set of chess pieces is provided with two additional queens (white and black). The pieces in this set are very specific -especially King, Queen and Bishop. The Knight is made ​​in the Russian style (note that the head is carved very meticulously its uniqueness being underlined by the horse''s mouth which is closed, slender and bent over a thick neck). They are made of acacia and boxwood. Our offer includes also ebonised Zagreb chess pieces.'),
(486, 'szachowo:877', 'French Staunton Ebonised 3,5" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 58.00, 0, 3, 1.1, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 89, "pieces_material": "Boxwood", "ean": "5902560353617", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI102 E350"}',
 'French Staunton set is a simple and yet elegant variety of popular Staunton chess pieces. All pieces are handmade by Indian craftsmen. Their appearance, especially beautiful polished surface, make them similar to far more expensive models of chess pieces. The robust and solid silhouette of knight is very characteristic for this particular model. The size 3,5'''' correspond to staunton no 5 pieces. All chess pieces are made of the highest quality boxwood (white) and ebonised boxwood (black). There are aditional queens (1 black and 1 white) in this set.'),
(487, 'szachowo:889', 'Stallion Knight Ebonised 3,75" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 108.00, 0, 5, 1.4, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 95, "pieces_material": "Boxwood", "ean": "5902560357646", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI105 E375"}',
 'Beautifull set of Stallion chess pieces is characterised by its English style. It is almost impossible to find such a good set in such an affordable price as we offer in our store. Stallion Ebonised set has beautiful details (e.g.: intricately carved king''s crown and queen''s head). "English stallion" - the knight''s piece, has a proudly raised head and bared teeth, ready to defend his king at all cost. Other chess pieces are also very beautifull, perfectly balanced with a smooth, polished surface. The black part of this set is made of ebonised hardwood that give them the appearance of ebony and eliminates many problems that affect ebony pieces. White pieces are made of boxwood. Stallion chess pieces set is equipped with two additional queens pieces.'),
(488, 'szachowo:531', 'German Staunton Acacia/Boxwood chess pieces 3,75'''' double queen', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 79.00, 0, 5, 1.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 95, "pieces_material": "Acacia/Boxwood", "ean": "5902560350401", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI101 S375 DQ"}',
 'The Staunton chess pieces are, in accordance with the rules of chess, the only type of chess pieces which can be used in the offcial chess tournaments. These chess pieces were made in the popular and well-liked German Staunton chess style. All pieces are carefully polished and weighted. The size of German Staunton 3,75'''' correspond to our Staunton No. 6 chess pieces. They are made from Acacia and Boxwood. The set is provided with two additional queens. The last picture presents those pieces on our Padouk chessboard of 50mm squares. The board is sold separately.'),
(489, 'szachowo:949', 'Empire Redwood 4,25" chess pieces', 'exclusive-pieces', 'sunrise-chess-games', 366.00, 0, 4, 1.7, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"king_height_mm": 112, "pieces_material": "Padauk", "ean": "5902560355789", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHI127 RED425"}',
