(653, 'szachowo:1467', 'DGT 3000 Limited Edition!', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 68.00, 30, 3, 0.5, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821592", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA20 LIMITED"}',
 'New electronic chess clock from DGT company! Special Limited Edition! The DGT3000 was launched in October 2014 and is DGT''s most advanced chess clock yet. It connects to all DGT e-Boards and is in full accordance with FIDE rules and regulations. The DGT3000 replaces the DGT XL and has many new features: - seconds are shown from the start - larger display with more information - 25 pre-set timing systems - 5 slots for customized settings - 5 year warranty!'),
(654, 'szachowo:167', 'DGT 2010', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 56.00, 42, 4, 0.45, 5.5, 10.7, 19.5,
 '{"dimensions": "55x195x107 mm", "ean": "8717662821097", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA03"}',
 'DGT 2010 is the official chess clock of the world chess federation FIDE. The DGT 2010 is the successor of the DGT 2000, which was the best selling digital chess clock ever with over 250,000 clocks sold world wide. At the end of 2010 it was replaced with a new version (with blue buttons) having additional features and functions. It includes 2 AA batteries.'),
(655, 'szachowo:494', 'DGT 3000', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 65.00, 47, 4, 0.5, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821431", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA20"}',
 'New electronic chess clock from DGT company! The DGT3000 was launched in October 2014 and is DGT''s most advanced chess clock yet. It connects to all DGT e-Boards and is in full accordance with FIDE rules and regulations. The DGT3000 replaces the DGT XL and has many new features: - seconds are shown from the start - larger display with more information - 25 pre-set timing systems - 5 slots for customized settings - 5 year warranty!'),
(656, 'szachowo:1469', 'DGT 1001 Black', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 21.00, 0, 4, 0.2, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821486", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA09 BLACK", "variant_group": "szachowo:digital-clocks-dgt-1001", "variant": {"Colour": "Black"}}',
 'The DGT1001 is a universal game timer suitable for school, club or home use. It has a crystal clear display, is extremely easy to use and very affordable. The DGT1001 features countdown and up-count and has two large buttons on the top left and right to operate the timer. The clock does not have bonus or delay options. It comes in two colour versions. Battery is included. Please see the manual for more information.'),
(657, 'szachowo:2271', 'DGT 2500', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 59.00, 43, 3, 0.5, 19.8, 6.0, 11.0,
 '{"dimensions": "198 x 110 x 60 mm", "ean": "8717662821943", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA07"}',
 'DGT 2500 is a brand new chess clock released by DGT. It is a successor of DGT 2010. The clock is approved by International Chess Federation FIDE. It has much bigger screen (174 x 32 mm) than its predecessor DGT2010 meanwhile its shape and button layout refer to DGT3000. It is covered by two year warranty.'),
(658, 'szachowo:543', 'DGT 1002 Bonus chess clock - New!', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 29.00, 0, 4, 0.2, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821509", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA02"}',
 'The DGT1002 is the simplest chess clock with bonus options available anywhere. It is extremely easy to set and use. Simply press + or - to set the time and the game can begin! Easy to understand and fun to use! This high quality DGT bonus timer fits nicely alongside any chess board due to its extra small footprint with a base that''s a mere 4,2 cm wide (length 155 mm, width 42 mm, height 60 mm). It operates on one battery (included) and comes with a 2 year warranty. A great little affordable chess clock with large display and clear digits - perfect simplicity of design and operation. Use the DGT1002 with increments and never run out of time!'),
(659, 'szachowo:1470', 'DGT 1001 White', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 21.00, 0, 4, 0.2, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821493", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA09 WHITE", "variant_group": "szachowo:digital-clocks-dgt-1001", "variant": {"Colour": "White"}}',
 'The DGT1001 is a universal game timer suitable for school, club or home use. It has a crystal clear display, is extremely easy to use and very affordable. The DGT1001 features countdown and up-count and has two large buttons on the top left and right to operate the timer. The clock does not have bonus or delay options. It comes in two colour versions. Battery is included. Please see the manual for more information.'),
(660, 'szachowo:3109', 'DGT 1500 Black', 'digital-clocks', 'dgt', 39.00, 33, 4, 0.4, 17.0, 5.8, 9.6,
 '{"ean": "8717662822117", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA08 BLACK", "variant_group": "szachowo:digital-clocks-dgt-1500", "variant": {"Colour": "Black"}}',
 'The latest DGT 1500 electronic chess clock is designed for high-speed chess games. A unique feature of this model is an additional position on the display showing tenths of a second. This is very helpful when every second counts. The large and clear display is ideal during intense games. The easy setup process allows players to start playing quickly, making the DGT 1500 the best choice for quick games. An important feature of the timer is the ability to set different times for each player. The timer''s state-of-the-art electronics are designed for exceptional performance, so it can easily run on just one battery. This feature only emphasizes its convenience and low maintenance costs. Technical Specifications Material: ABS plastic Power supply: 1x AA battery (included) Delay: Yes Bonus: Yes Period: 1 Dimensions: Clock dimensions (L x W x H): 170 x 96 x 58 mm (6.7", 3.8", 2.3") Clock weight (with battery): 220 grams (7.8 oz) Display size (l x h): 136 mm x 25 mm (5.4“ x 1.0”) Box dimensions (L x W x H): 180 x 105 x 65 mm (7" x 4.1" x 2.5") Translated with DeepL.com (free version).'),
(661, 'szachowo:3108', 'DGT 1500 Blue', 'digital-clocks', 'dgt', 39.00, 26, 4, 0.4, 17.0, 5.8, 9.6,
 '{"ean": "8717662822124", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA08 BLUE", "variant_group": "szachowo:digital-clocks-dgt-1500", "variant": {"Colour": "Blue"}}',
 'The latest DGT 1500 electronic chess clock is designed for high-speed chess games. A unique feature of this model is an additional position on the display showing tenths of a second. This is very helpful when every second counts. The large and clear display is ideal during intense games. The easy setup process allows players to start playing quickly, making the DGT 1500 the best choice for quick games. An important feature of the timer is the ability to set different times for each player. The timer''s state-of-the-art electronics are designed for exceptional performance, so it can easily run on just one battery. This feature only emphasizes its convenience and low maintenance costs. Technical Specifications Material: ABS plastic Power supply: 1x AA battery (included) Delay: Yes Bonus: Yes Period: 1 Dimensions: Clock dimensions (L x W x H): 170 x 96 x 58 mm (6.7", 3.8", 2.3") Clock weight (with battery): 220 grams (7.8 oz) Display size (l x h): 136 mm x 25 mm (5.4“ x 1.0”) Box dimensions (L x W x H): 180 x 105 x 65 mm (7" x 4.1" x 2.5") Translated with DeepL.com (free version).'),
(662, 'szachowo:1667', 'DGT1006 Backgammon Clock', 'digital-clocks', 'dgt', 25.00, 43, 5, 0.2, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821585", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA46"}',
 'The DGT1006 Backgammon Clock is not only ideal for playing Backgammon but is also great for a wide range of games such as Chess, Checkers, Poker, Scrabble™, Lost Cities, Party & Co, Dominoes, Boggle, Settlers, Carcassonne, Trivial Pursuit, Monopoly or any other two-player game. Simply switch it on, set the game time as desired and start the timer. With its handy top buttons and large display, the DGT1006 Backgammon timer is very easy to program and intuitive to use. It features a timer with one period and a special delay function! During the delay, the timer will not count down for either player. Once it is over, the clock will start counting down the time. Runs on one AA battery (included) and comes with a 2-year warranty. As General Distributor of DGT products, we operate the fastest warranty service for electronic chess clocks. A new clock is dispatched upon receipt and inspection of the advertised (sent back under warranty) product.'),
(663, 'szachowo:1468', 'DGT 1005 Byo-Yomi Timer', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 25.00, 0, 4, 0.2, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821523", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA45"}',
 'The high quality DGT1005 Byo-yomi timer is a clock programmed with Japanese Byo-yomi timing options and especially designed for the ancient games Shogi and Go. Shogi and Go players love the DGT1005 Byo-yomi game timer because it has a beautiful design, it is very affordable and it is easy to set and to use. Simply set the game time, set the Byo-yomi period time and the number of Byo-yomi periods (from 0 up to 9) and start the clock. It has a clear display which makes it easy to check your time in the blink of an eye with has a clear indication which player’s clock is running. The game timer has a fitting design in the traditional black and white colors of Go stones. The DGT1005 Byo-yomi timer fits nicely alongside any Go board due to it''s small footprint and it is very compact so you can easily take it with you. It is perfect for games at tournaments, the club or your casual Shogi or Go game at home. Without the hassle of needing to go through complicated menus, you will be set and ready for another game in no time.'),
(664, 'szachowo:2056', '10 timers with time addition DGT 1002 (pack)', 'digital-clocks', 'dgt', 349.00, 44, 4, 6.0, 15.5, 4.2, 6.0,
 '{"ean": "5902560358766", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "PACZKA 1002"}',
 'Special offer for schools, chess clubs, unions! Pack of 10 DGT 1002 clocks DGT 1002 is the simplest chess clock available on the market with the "BONUS" option (adding time for the move made). It is extremely easy to operate and very pleasant to use. Simply press + or - to set the desired time. Because of the small space this chess clock occupies, it can be placed next to any chessboard even with little table space. The DGT 1002 Chess Clock runs on a single battery (included) and also comes with a 2-year warranty (you will replace it with a new clock in our shop under warranty). This excellent, compact chess clock with a large, clear display (115 x 17mm), classic and pleasing to the eye will give you a lot of fun and add flavour to any game, not only chess. Use the DGT 1002 with the option to add time, and you will never run out of it! Technical specifications: Battery - One AA battery Difference - Less than 1 second per hour Body ABS plastic (various colours) Display - 115 x 17 mm Total clock size -. 155 x 60 x 42 mm Weight - 105 grams (including battery) As General Distributor of DGT products, we provide the fastest warranty service for electronic chess clocks.'),
(665, 'szachowo:2054', '10 DGT 1001 clocks in black (pack)', 'digital-clocks', 'dgt', 290.00, 32, 5, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "5902560358759", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "PACZKA 1001 BLACK", "variant_group": "szachowo:digital-clocks-10-dgt-1001-clocks-in", "variant": {"Colour": "Black"}}',
 'Special offer for schools, chess clubs, unions! Pack of 10 DGT 1001 clocks in black The DGT 1001 electronic chess clock features a large, clear display, is simple to use and classic in its design. The DGT 1001 has a small size, so that it is not only easier to transport, but can even fit on a small table or bench. The weight of the clock with battery is just over 100 grams ! Its biggest advantage, however, is its price - much lower than the price of most clocks available on the market. The clock comes in two colour versions - black/white and white/blue. Both versions are available in our shop. The DGT 1001 Clock is ideal for schools and chess clubs, so both schools and clubs interested in buying this clock can count on special discounts! Technical specifications: Battery - One AA battery Difference - Less than 1 second per hour Body ABS plastic (various colours) Display - 115 x 17 mm Total size of clock -. 155 x 60 x 42 mm Weight - 105 grams (including battery) As General Distributor of DGT products, we provide the fastest warranty service for electronic chess clocks.'),
