 'Special offer for schools, chess clubs, unions! Pack of 10 DGT 1001 clocks in white The DGT 1001 electronic chess clock features a large, clear display, is simple to use and classic in its design. The DGT 1001 is small in size, so it is not only easier to transport, but can even fit on a small table or bench. The weight of the clock with battery is just over 100 grams ! Its biggest advantage, however, is its price - much lower than the price of most clocks available on the market. The clock comes in two colour versions - black/white and white/blue. Both versions are available in our shop. The DGT 1001 Clock is ideal for schools and chess clubs, so both schools and clubs interested in buying this clock can count on special discounts! Technical specifications: Battery - One AA battery Difference - Less than 1 second per hour Body ABS plastic (various colours) Display - 115 x 17 mm Total size of clock -. 155 x 60 x 42 mm Weight - 105 grams (including battery) As General Distributor of DGT products, we provide the fastest warranty service for electronic chess clocks. Shipping of a new clock takes place after receipt and inspection of the advertised (sent back for warranty) product.'),
(667, 'szachowo:2053', '10 DGT 2010 clocks (pack)', 'digital-clocks', 'dgt', 870.00, 42, 5, 6.0, NULL, NULL, NULL,
