 'Special offer for schools, chess clubs, associations! Pack of 10 DGT 2010 clocks The DGT 2010 is the official chess clock of the International Chess Federation ( FIDE ), as certified by this organisation (FIDE certificate). It is one of the best professional electronic chess clocks currently available on the market. The latest version available in our shop has 2 additional (36 in total) game tempo settings. Characteristic features of the DGT 2010 clock include: large, easy-to-read display comfortable and robust clock levers housing and buttons made of high quality materials 36 tempo setting options (table below) 2-year warranty. batteries included (2 sticks) Technical specifications: Battery - Two AA-stick batteries (included with clock) Difference - Less than 1 second per hour Housing - ABS plastic Colour -. Burgundy Display - 135 x 25 mm Total clock size - 195 x 107 x 55 mm Weight - 210 grams 1. time blitz - 5 minutes each 2. time rapid - 25 minutes each 3. time set by hand 4. time + guilotine 2h + 30 min for completion 5. time + guilotine - set own manual 6. 2x time + guilotine 2h + 1h + 30 min for completion 7. 2xtime + guilotine setting own manual 8.'),
(668, 'szachowo:1090', 'DGT Pi chess computer', 'digital-clocks', 'sunrise-chess-games', 371.00, 5, 5, 0.9, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"ean": "8717662821448", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "CHCA25"}',
 'DGT Pi is a chess computer which will make of your E-board the strongest sparing partner. DGT Pi is provided with 8 chess engines offering different styles and rating. The device is not complex. All you have to do is plug DGT Pi to the E-board and start a game. The opponents'' moves will be displayed on the screen. DGT Pi is a flawless device. It is possible to play him, train with him, analyse positions and variations. It can be used as well as a standard chess clock (DGT3000). DGT Pi has the following engins: StockFish 7 ( ELO 3100) Texel 1.06 ( ELO 800 - 2900) Arasan 18.3 ( ELO 1000 - 2600) Rodent ll ( ELO 2650) Zurichess G ( ELO 2450) Floyd 0.8 ( ELO 2300) Cinnamon 2 ( ELO 2000) Claudia 0.5 ( ELO 1650).'),
