 'SMART technology has been developed specifically to make the product more affordable than DGT wooden chessboards, to make live broadcasts of chess matches more accessible and reach a wider audience. The kit includes: The kit includes: DGT SMART BOARD electronic chess board with description A set of DGT plastic electronic pieces Cabling kit for individual use and Fritz 14 The Smart Boards are made of high quality plastic providing the same functionality and experience as the wooden electronic boards. Smart Boards can be used in many different ways at home, club or tournament. Online play Play online against opponents from all over the world using the Smart Board as an input device, for example on Playchess.com. Your opponents moves (human or motor) are shown on the display of the DGT3000 chess clock connected to the board. Recording chess games Use the Smart Board to record your games for later download and analysis. Gaming, training, analysis and learning Smart Board works with the most powerful chess software and chess programs available for desktop or laptop computers. Order a DGT Pi, chess computer to turn the Smart Board into your strongest sparring partner.'),
