 '{"ean": "9789056918378", "supplier": "Sunrise Chess & Games", "supplier_sku": "9789056918378"}',
 'New In Chess Magazine #2/2019 New in Chess has 8 issues a year with more than 800 pages of the very best in chess: on-the-spot tournament reports, columns, both serious and hilarious, in-depth interviews, chess opening surprises, chess history that comes to life, endgames and studies, chess anecdotes and curiosities, great pictures and drawings, an honest GM opinion on the latest chess books, exclusive columns.'),
(1451, 'szachowo:2415', 'New In Chess 2019/2', 'more-chess-books', 'new-in-chess', 14.00, 31, 5, 0.23, NULL, NULL, NULL,
