(1684, 'ymi:8920272797870', 'Bamboo Go Game Set - 12.6 x 12.2" Wooden Board with Pull-Out Storage Drawers & Double Convex Melamine Stones', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 19.45, 10, 4, 3.63, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TBS01-A", "stones": "melamine", "wood": "bamboo"}',
 'Embrace the enduring strategy of Go with this finely crafted Bamboo Go Game Set from Yellow Mountain Imports. Featuring a full-size 19x19 grid and made from natural bamboo, the board offers both traditional style and long-lasting performance. The set includes double convex melamine stones-known for their durability and pleasing tactile feel-as well as two built-in drawers for easy, space-saving storage. Every element of the set is designed to enhance both playability and presentation-from the smooth bamboo board to the satisfying weight of the melamine stones. Whether you''re exploring the game for the first time or adding to your collection, this set combines elegance, utility, and the joy of thoughtful design. “The Way to Go” booklet makes it easy to start learning or teaching Go right away. Wooden Go Board: Crafted from solid strips of bamboo for a smooth, durable surface with timeless appeal. Full-size 19x19 grid with 15mm squares. Board dimensions: 12.7 x 12.2 x 2.7". Double Convex Melamine Stones: Includes 181 black and 180 white stones (Size: 13mm x 4mm). Made from impact-resistant melamine for lasting use and a satisfying feel.'),
(1685, 'ymi:8847837528238', 'Go Game Set with Reversible (13x13/9x9) Shin Kaya Go Boa', 'go-accessories', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 38.69, 0, 3, 1.98, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "4Z-6QBR-1I6V", "board_size": "13/9"}',
 'Yellow Mountain Imports prides itself on honoring Eastern traditions that translate well to enjoying your favorite games from anywhere in the world! Yellow Mountain Imports Shin Kaya Go Board Set: This table board is made from one solid piece of shin kaya wood. It''s truly a symbol of quality and tradition that perfectly embodies the beauty of the game. Our shin kaya Go boards are made of Tibetan spruce from Yunnan province in southern China. This type of wood is also known as ''''dragon spruce'''' and ''''picea asperata'''' in Latin. The lines are individually hand drawn. Durable Double Convex Stones: This board is paired with a set of double convex melamine stones. Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound commonly used when strength is essential, such as kitchen counters and industrial applications. Japanese Standard Size: The grids are 21.5 x 23 millimeters.'),
(1686, 'ymi:8847837462702', '1-1/8" Solid Shin-Kaya Spruce Go Game Table Board', 'go-boards', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 55.03, 0, 5, 3.69, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TS005-A"}',
 NULL),
(1687, 'ymi:8847837102254', 'Etched Bamboo Go Board (0.8" ) w/ Double Convex Yunzi Stones (Size 32) and Jujub', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 110.93, 0, 3, 6.49, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB003-A_YN-SB020-A", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "bamboo"}',
 'At Yellow Mountain Imports, we offer the highest quality materials and attention to detail. We produce the finest Go Sets available on the market today. Here’s why: Buy with confidence. Quality Board - This board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time. The lines are etched onto the board in the fashion of the ancient Go boards. It has a 19x19 playing field on one side and a 13x13 playing field on the other. Yunzi Stones - These double convex Yunzi stones have a balance and a deeply rich color that are instantly noticeable. The texture, symmetry, and precision of these stones are superior. Bamboo Bowls - A pair of bamboo bowls is included with securing straps for bowl lids and a vinyl carrying case for stones and bowls. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee - Here, at Yellow Mountain Imports, we stand behind our product. And with this level of quality, we are confident that you will not want to return it. If for any reason, however, you would like to return it, you can take advantage of our 30 day return policy.'),
(1688, 'ymi:8847816949934', 'Protective Sleeve for 1.2" (3.0cm) Japanese Standard Go Board', 'go-accessories', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 25.79, 0, 3, 0.31, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-XH003-A"}',
 'A high quality Go board deserves high quality protection between games. Slip your Go board into this thick and sturdy soft felt sleeve with Velcro seal and your Go board will be protected from nicks, scratches, and dust. Will fit any standard 17-15/16" x 16-3/4" (45.5cm x 42.5cm) (Japanese Standard) Go board up to 1-3/16" (3.0 cm) thick. Sleeve measures 18-1/8" L x 16-15/16" W x 1-3/16" H (460mm x 430mm x 30mm).'),
(1689, 'ymi:8847816884398', 'Portable Magnetic 13x13 Go Game Set Board (7.9 x 6.7") w/ Single Convex Stones', 'magnetic-go', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 13.12, 0, 5, 0.2, 20.0, 0.5, 17.0,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "UB-PM001-A"}',
 'This ultra-portable, wallet-sized, magnetic, folding 13x13 Go game set will fit just about anywhere so you can play on the go! Compact Lightweight Board: The board measures 7.9 x 6.7 x 0.2 inch (20 x 17 x 0.5 centimeter) when laid out flat; When folded, it''s small enough to fit in your pocket; The entire set weighs 0.18kg (0.4 lbs). Magnetic Go Set: Plastic go stones magnetically attach to the board allowing you to play on the go; Bring this set with you on planes, to the park, or Go clubs, and always enjoy a challenging game. Single Convex Go Stones: Each stone measures approximately 0.04 x 0.39 inch (0.1 x 1.0 centimeter); The set includes 91 black and 91 white plastic go stones which can be stored inside the board after play. 13x13 Playing Field: Enjoy quick games or learn the fundamentals with the 13x13 playing field. 100% Satisfaction Assured: This set has been made with excellence in mind. If for any reason you''re unsatisfied, please contact us within 30 days for a refund.'),
(1690, 'ymi:8847816786094', 'Yunzi Single Go Game Convex Stones and Jujube Bowls - 21.5-22mm (Size 3)', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 59.33, 0, 4, 3.2, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-SB003-A", "stones": "yunzi"}',
 'This is a set of Yunzi professional Go stones, China''s finest. If you haven''t played with these stones before you''ll find it to be a completely different experience than playing with glass or plastic stones. The stones have a balance and deep coloring that is instantly noticeable, and leave an audible "snap" as you place them on the board. The texture, symmetry, and precision of these Go sets is captivating and sublimely captures the essence of the game. These stones are "single convex." One side is flat with a slight rounding on the edge, the other is fully rounded. Whether to play with single convex or double convex is a matter of personal taste. In general, Chinese Go players prefer these single convex stones for their feel and much louder snapping sound when played. The Yunzi stones are matched with a pair of bowls jujube date wood bowls, golden silk lid liners and a vinyl carrying case. Each bowl is hollowed out from a single piece of wood. In addition to their natural beauty, they are highly durable, keep their sha 181 black and 180 white genuine Yunzi stones. 21.5-22mm (Size 3) single convex stones measure 5.6mm tall and 22mm wide (approximately 0.22" x 0.87").'),
(1691, 'ymi:3862160195', 'Beechwood Veneer 0.4" Etched Beginner''s Reversible 9x9/13x13 Go Game Set Board with Single Convex Melamine Stones', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 17.12, 0, 4, 2.72, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-LV002-A_US-SF001-A", "stones": "melamine", "wood": "beechwood", "variant_group": "ymi:go-sets-beechwood-veneer-0-4-etched-beginner-s-reversible-9x9-13x13", "variant": {"Stones": "Melamine, single convex"}}',
 'The perfect set to learn or teach go. The 9x9 grid is ideal for fast and instructive games and the 13x13 side for deeper fundamentals and quick games. Less intimidating than larger boards, this set makes go instantly fun for those new to the game. REVERSIBLE GO BOARD (GOBAN): This board comes with 9x9 and 13x13 playing fields etched into the wood; The 9x9 grid is ideal for beginners while the 13x13 is helpful for learning fundamentals and for quick games. BEECHWOOD VENEER BOARD: The board measures 13 x 13 x 0.4 inch（35 x 33 x 0.9 centimeters) and is made from beechwood veneer; Grid size: 23 x 24mm (9x9 side) and 22 x 23mm (13x13 side). SINGLE CONVEX STONES: Includes 181 black and 180 white size 3 melamine stones each measuring 5.7 x 22 millimeters (about 0.22 x 0.86 inch); These single-convex stones produce a louder ''snap'' from the flat side when played on the board and can be flipped over for playing out variations when reviewing a game; Includes two plastic bowls for storage. ENTIRE SET WEIGHS 4.18lbs (1.9kg). THE WAY TO GO: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go.'),
(1692, 'ymi:7853429555374', 'Bamboo 0.8" Etched Reversible 19x19/13x13 Go Game Set Board with Double Convex Melamine Stones & Jujube Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 86.00, 0, 3, 6.68, 47.3, 2.0, 44.2,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB003-A_YN-SB032-A", "stones": "melamine", "wood": "bamboo", "variant_group": "ymi:go-sets-bamboo-0-8-etched-reversible-19x19-13x13", "variant": {"Stones": "Melamine, double convex", "Bowls": "Jujube"}}',
 'Elevate your Go skills with our premium Go Game Set. Crafted from durable bamboo, the board boasts perfectly etched grids that add a touch of refinement. Complete with black and white melamine stones and elegant jujube bowls, it''s the perfect set for a captivating and authentic gameplay experience. Reversible Go Board (Goban): This board comes with 19x19 and 13x13 etched playing fields; The 19x19 side is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning the basics and for quick games; Board measures 18.6 x 17.4 x 0.8 inches (47.3 x 44.2 x 2 centimeters) and includes felt board sleeve for protection. Double Convex Stones: Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound; These are excellent stones to use in an environment where the stones will be put to constant, hard use; They have a satisfying heft and snap to them; Includes 181 black and 180 white size 33 stones, each measuring 9 x 22 millimeters (approximately 0.36 x 0.87 inch). Set of 2 Wild Jujube Bowls: Also known as Chinese date wood, jujube is a hard and sturdy species; Each deep, natural grained bowl measures 5.7 x 3.5 inches (14.6 x 9 centimeters); Securing bowl straps and a vinyl carrying case are also included.'),
(1693, 'ymi:7851269619886', 'Shin Kaya 1.3" Reversible 19x19 / 9x9 Go Game Set Board with Double Convex Yunzi Stones and Jujube Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 86.00, 0, 3, 8.24, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TS016-A_YN-SB001-A", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "shin kaya"}',
 'Build and conquer territories in a game of Go with this reversible Shin Kaya Go board set. Includes jujube bowls and double convex Yunzi stones. REVERSIBLE GO BOARD (GOBAN): This board comes with 19x19 and 9x9 playing fields; The 19x19 side is for standard gameplay, while the 9x9 is great for learning rules and fundamentals. SHIN KAYA GO BOARD: Shin Kaya is valued for the resonating sound it creates when the stone hits the wood, its soft touch, beautiful grain patterns, color, shine, and even fragrance; Wood grain may vary slightly from photos; The board measures 18.6 x 17.4 x 1.3" (47.2 x 44.2 x 3.1cm) with Japanese standard size grids of 22 x 23mm; Includes felt board sleeve for protection. DOUBLE CONVEX STONES: Yunzi stones have been made for almost a thousand years from the Yunnan Province in southern China; They''re beautiful to look at, carry a nice heavy feel, and possess deep sounding ''snap'' qualities; They''re also the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments; Each stone measures 9.2 x 21mm (about 0.36 x 0.83").'),
(1694, 'ymi:7843750903982', 'Rosewood 1" Folding Go Game Set Board with Double Convex Melamine Stones', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 62.77, 0, 4, 3.17, 49.0, 2.6, 48.1,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-PV002-A", "stones": "melamine", "wood": "rosewood"}',
 'Experience the timeless strategy game of Go with this graceful set. The board is crafted from rosewood veneer with inlaid grid lines and conveniently folds for easy storage. The double convex stones provide a satisfying weight and feel as you make your moves. Perfect for players of all levels. Rosewood Go Board: This smooth surfaced go board (goban) is crafted with rosewood veneer; It easily folds in half for compact storage. 19 x 19 Playing Field: Comes with 19x19 Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23 millimeters for standard gameplay; Board measures 19.3 x 18.9 x 1 inches (49 x 48.1 x 2.6 centimeters) when open and 18.9 x 9.6 x 2 inches (48.1 x 24.4 x 5.2 cm) when closed. It is kept secure by hidden inset magnets. Double Convex Stones: 181 black and 180 white size 28 Go stones made from durable melamine are included in the set; Each stone measures 21 x 7.5 millimeters. Removable Go Stone Containers: Inside the board are removable containers for the stones; You may use the containers to hold your stones while at play or to secure them inside the board after the game; Entire set weighs 6.06lbs (2.75kg).'),
(1695, 'ymi:6085832278190', 'Beechwood Veneer 0.4" Etched Beginner''s Reversible 9x9/13x13 Go Game Set Board with Double Convex Melamine Stones', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 43.85, 0, 3, 2.72, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-LV002-A_US-SF002-A", "stones": "melamine", "wood": "beechwood", "variant_group": "ymi:go-sets-beechwood-veneer-0-4-etched-beginner-s-reversible-9x9-13x13", "variant": {"Stones": "Melamine, double convex"}}',
 'The perfect set to learn or teach go. The 9x9 grid is ideal for fast and instructive games and the 13x13 side for deeper fundamentals and quick games. This set is less intimidating than larger boards and makes go instantly fun for those new to the game. Reversible Go Board (Goban): This board comes with 9x9 and 13x13 playing fields etched into the wood; The 9x9 grid is ideal for beginners while the 13x13 is great for learning fundamentals and for quick games. Beechwood Veneer Board: The board measures 13 x 13 x 0.4 inch（35 x 33 x 0.9 centimeters) and is made from beechwood veneer; Grid size: 23 x 24mm (9x9 side) and 22 x 23mm (13x13 side). Double Convex Stones: Includes 181 black and 180 white size 33 melamine stones each measuring 7.5 x 22-millimeter (about 0.3 x 0.83 inch); Includes two plastic bowls for storage. Entire Set Weighs 4.19lbs (1.9kg). The Way To Go: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go.'),
(1696, 'ymi:4671102484561', 'Double Convex Melamine Go Game Stones Set with Jujube Bowls - Size 33 (9 millimeters)', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 51.59, 0, 3, 2.64, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-SB033-A", "stones": "melamine", "variant_group": "ymi:go-stones-double-33", "variant": {"Stones": "Melamine, double convex", "Bowls": "Jujube"}}',
 'Revel in the crisp snap of perfectly-shaped entry to intermediate level Go stones paired with jujube bowls. DOUBLE CONVEX STONES: Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound; They make excellent go stones especially if the stones will be put to constant, hard use; Also, they have a satisfying feel and snap to them; Includes 181 black and 180 white size 33 stones each measuring 9 x 22-millimeter (approximately 0.36 x 0.87 inch). SET OF 2 JUJUBE GO BOWLS: Also known as Chinese date wood, jujube is a hard and sturdy species; Each deep, natural grained bowl measures 5.7 x 5.7 x 4.2"(15 x 15 x 10.6 cm); The entire set weighs 2.27kg (5lbs). SECURE AND HANDY STORAGE: The set comes with bowl securing straps and a carrying bag for easy transport and storage; Go board is not included. THE WAY TO GO: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go.'),
(1697, 'ymi:4666371801169', 'Double Convex Melamine Go Game Stones Set with Jujube Bowls - Size 32 (9 millimeters)', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 30.89, 0, 3, 2.62, 14.6, NULL, 9.0,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-SB032-A", "stones": "melamine"}',
 'Upgrade your Go game with this set of durable melamine Go stones and pair of stunning jujube bowls. DOUBLE CONVEX STONES: Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound; These are excellent stones to use in an environment where the stones will be put to constant, hard use; They have a satisfying heft and snap to them; Includes 181 black and 180 white size 32 stones each measuring 9 x 22-millimeter (approximately 0.36 x 0.87 inch). SET OF 2 WILD JUJUBE BOWLS: Also known as Chinese date wood, jujube is a hard and sturdy species; Each deep, natural grained bowl measures 5.7 x 3.5 inches (14.6 x 9 centimeters). SECURE YOUR GO SET: The set comes with bowl securing straps and a carrying bag for easy transport and storage; Go board is not included in the set. THE WAY TO GO: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go.'),
(1698, 'ymi:3768815811', 'Magnetic 19x19 Roll-up Go Game Set Board (14.4 x 13.6") with Single Convex Stones', 'magnetic-go', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 58.47, 0, 3, 1.36, 36.6, 0.1, 34.5,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "QQ-PM001-B"}',
 'Play, study or teach Go on this handy magnetic set with 19x19 playing field. It rolls up easily into a carrying tube, yet will lay flat on any surface. Portable Board: At 0.04 inch (0.1 centimeter) thick, the board (goban) rolls up easily and fits in the tube-shaped carrying case; When it''s time to play, simply roll out the board flat; The board measures 14.4 x 13.6 x 0.04 inches (36.6 x 34.5 x 0.1 centimeters); The entire set weighs 1.12kg (2.5 lbs). Magnetic Go Set: Plastic go stones magnetically attach to the board allowing you to play on the go; Bring this set with you on planes, to the park, or Go clubs, and always enjoy a challenging game; Stick the magnetic board up on a dry erase board or on the refrigerator to ponder go strategies or lead small group instructions. 19x19 Playing Field: Enjoy standard gameplay with a 19x19 playing field and single convex go stones (180 white stones, 181 black stones); Each stone measures 0.2 x 0.7 inch (5 x 17 millimeters), big enough to play with ease; The set includes pouches for the playing pieces.'),
(1699, 'ymi:3768897795', 'Beechwood Veneer 0.4" Etched Beginner''s 9x9 Go Game Board (Goban)', 'go-boards', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 17.19, 0, 3, 0.44, 25.0, 1.0, 23.5,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-LV001-A", "wood": "beechwood"}',
 'Its 9x9 grid makes this go board ideal for fast and instructive games. Perfect choice to learn or teach go. 9X9 PLAYING FIELD: This board comes with 9x9 grid etched into the wood; Ideal for beginners to learn on and enjoy practice games. BEECHWOOD VENEER BOARD: The board measures 9.84 x 9.25 x 0.39 inch (25 x 23.5 x 1 centimeter) with 24 x 25mm grid size. FELT BOTTOM SURFACE: The bottom is covered in felt giving it the needed grip while retaining a traditional feel. LIGHTWEIGHT GOBAN: At 0.9lb (0.4kg), you can take this board with you together with your favorite stones and play Go anywhere; Leave one in your office or school locker so you can easily practice your Go skills. BOARD ONLY: Go game stones and bowls are not included.'),
(1700, 'ymi:3768899139', 'Cherry Wood Pattern 0.8" Folding Go Game Set Board with Double Convex Melamine Stones', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 60.19, 0, 5, 3.17, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-PV001-A", "stones": "melamine", "wood": "cherry"}',
 'Experience the timeless strategy game of Go with this quality set. The board is crafted from elegant cherry wood veneer and conveniently folds for easy storage. The double convex stones provide a satisfying weight and feel as you make your moves. Perfect for players of all levels. Cherry Wood Pattern Board with Gold Accents: This two-toned wooden Go board is crafted with cherry veneer and gold colored grids; It easily folds in half for compact storage. 19 X 19 Playing Field: Comes with 19x19 Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters for standard gameplay; Board measures 19.3x 18.9 x 1" (49 x 48.1 x 2.6 cm) when open and 18.9 x 9.6 x 2" (48.1 x 24.4 x 5.2 cm) when closed. Double Convex Stones: 181 black and 180 white size 28 Go stones made from durable melamine are included in the set; Each stone measures 7.5 x 21 millimeters (approximately 0.30 x 0.83 inch). Felt Lined Storage: Inside the board are organizational sections with felt-covered containers for the stones; Decorative metal clasps keep the board securely locked after play. The Way To Go: The set comes with Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go.'),
(1701, 'ymi:3768907459', 'Single Convex Melamine Go Game Stones Set with Jujube Bowls - Size 3 (22mm)', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 49.88, 0, 5, 3.47, 15.0, 10.6, 15.0,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-SB001-D", "stones": "melamine"}',
 'Prepare to take over the board on this set of single convex melamine go game stones paired with jujube bowls. Single Convex Stones: Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound; They make excellent go stones especially if the stones will be put to constant, hard use; Also, they have a satisfying feel and snap to them; Includes 181 black and 180 white size 3 stones each measuring 7.5 x 22-millimeter (approximately 0.30 x 0.86 inch). Set of 2 Jujube Go Bowls: Also known as Chinese date wood, jujube is a hard and sturdy species; Each deep, natural grained go game bowl measures 5.7 x 5.7 x 4.2 inches (15 x 15 x 10.6 centimeters). Includes microfiber cloth for cleaning and polishing your Go stones and bowls; Also comes with securing straps for the bowls; Go board is not included. The Way to Go: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go. The entire set weighs 2.9kg (6.3lbs).'),
(1702, 'ymi:3768908483', 'Melamine Double Convex Go Game Stones Set - 7.5-Millimeter (Size 28)', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 18.05, 0, 4, 1.12, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-SF002-A", "stones": "melamine"}',
 'Master your two-finger grasp technique on this set of double convex melamine go game stones. This set offers durability, heft and excellent value! Complete Go Game Stones Set: 181 black and 180 white 21-millimeter (size 28) go game stones paired with 2 plastic bowls (gosu); Each stone measures 7.5 x 21 millimeters. Scratch-Resistant Melamine Stones: Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound; These are excellent stones to use in an environment where the stones will be put to constant, hard use; They also have a satisfying heft and snap to them. Double Convex Stones: These stones create deeper knocking sound compared to single convex stones. Versatile Stones: These size 28 stones will fit Japanese, Chinese, and Korean standard size Go game boards. Great For Go Clubs, starter sets, or as a substitute for when you do not want to use your expensive set of stones; Go board is not included.'),
(1703, 'ymi:3768907907', 'Melamine Single Convex Go Game Stones Set - 22-Millimeters (Size 3)', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 14.33, 0, 3, 1.14, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-SF001-A", "stones": "melamine"}',
 'Master your two-finger technique on this set of single convex melamine go game stones. This set offers durability, heft, and excellent value! Complete Go Game Stones Set: 181 black and 180 white 22-millimeters wide (size 3) go game stones paired with 2 plastic bowls (gosu); Each stone measures 5.7 x 22mm (about 0.22 x 0.86 inch). Scratch-Resistant Melamine Stones: Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound; These are excellent stones to use in an environment where the stones will be put to constant, hard use; They also have a satisfying heft and snap to them. Single Convex Stones: These stones are flat on the bottom side; thus, they produce a louder slapping sound while double convex stones create a deeper knocking sound. Versatile Stones: These size 3 stones will fit Japanese, Chinese, and Korean standard size Go game boards. Great For Go Clubs, starter sets, or as a substitute for when you do not want to use your expensive set of stones; Go board is not included.'),
(1704, 'ymi:3768948739', 'Bamboo 2" Go Table Board Goban', 'go-boards', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 68.78, 0, 3, 7.86, 47.0, 5.0, 44.0,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB002-C", "wood": "bamboo"}',
 'You''ll appreciate the natural beauty and rich dark colors of this 2" (50mm) thick bamboo board. This board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time. Not only is bamboo beautiful, but it is also durable, environmentally friendly and sustainable. One side is a Chinese standard 19 x 19 Goban, and on the opposite side is a 13 x 13 board. Never leave home without the answers to any game questions with included instruction booklet, "The Way to Go", by Karl Baker. Durable Bamboo Board: Weighing close to 15 pounds, this board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time. Not only is bamboo beautiful, but it is also durable, environmentally friendly and sustainable; wood grain may vary slightly from photos. Chinese Grid Size: You''ll absolutely love the grid of this board, the grid size is 23 x 25 millimeters, and the board measures 18.5 x 17.3 x 2 inches (47 x 44 x 5 centimeters). Reversible Go Board (Goban): The 13x13 playing field keeps your skills sharp by allowing you to play shorter games when you don''t have time for a full length one.'),
(1705, 'ymi:3768947907', 'Bamboo 0.8" Reversible 19x19 / 13x13 Go Game Set Board with Single Convex Yunzi Stones and Bamboo Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 111.79, 0, 5, 7.65, 47.3, 2.0, 44.2,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB001-A_YN-SB018-A", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "bamboo", "variant_group": "ymi:go-sets-bamboo-0-8-reversible-19x19-13x13", "variant": {"Stones": "Yunzi, single convex", "Bowls": "Bamboo"}}',
 'Play, master, and enjoy one of the world''s oldest strategy games on a 19x19/13x13 bamboo board with genuine single convex Yunzi stones and bamboo bowls. REVERSIBLE GO BOARD (GOBAN): The 19x19 side is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals and for quick games; The board measures 18.6 x 17.4 x 0.8 inch (47.3 x 44.2 x 2 centimeters) with Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. BAMBOO BOARD: This board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time; Bamboo is known for its beauty, sturdiness, and sustainability; Wood grain may vary slightly from photos; A protective felt sleeve is included with the board. SINGLE CONVEX STONES: Yunzi stones have been traditionally made for almost a thousand years from the Yunnan Province in southern China; They''re also the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments; These single-convex stones produce a louder ''snap'' from the flat side when played on the board and can be flipped over for playing out variations when reviewing a game; Each size 3 stone measures 5.7 x 22 millimeters (about 0.22 x 0.86 inch).'),
(1706, 'ymi:3768951555', 'Bamboo 0.8" Etched Reversible 19x19 / 13x13 Go Game Board (Goban)', 'go-boards', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 45.57, 0, 5, 4.52, 47.3, 2.0, 44.2,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB003-A", "wood": "bamboo"}',
 'Beautiful and durable, this board is made out of solid bamboo with reversible 19x19 and 13x13 playing fields engraved into the surfaces. STRENGTH AND BEAUTY: Combine bamboo, a grass species with the tensile strength of iron - with the timeless game of Go, a game so complicated that it''s been calculated there are more possible Go games than there are protons in the universe. TWO BOARDS IN ONE: This reversible board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time with a 19x19 full-sized board and 13x13 quick game board etched into the wood. CHINESE STANDARD SIZE: Board measures 18.6 x 17.4 x 0.8 inch (47.3 x 44.2 x 2 centimeters) with 22 x 23.5 millimeters engraved grids. THE WAY TO GO: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go. BOARD ONLY: Go game stones and bowls are not included.'),
(1707, 'ymi:3768955331', 'Shin Kaya 1.2" Reversible 19x19 / 13x13 Go Game Board (Goban)', 'go-boards', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 73.09, 0, 5, 3.76, 47.0, 3.1, 44.0,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TS012-A", "wood": "shin kaya"}',
 'Graceful and sturdy, this Japanese standard size Go game board is made out of shin kaya wood. It comes with reversible 19x19 and 13x13 playing fields. Reversible Go Board (Goban): 19x19 playing field on one side and 13x13 on the other; The 19x19 side is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for shorter games. Shin Kaya Go Board: Shin Kaya is valued for the resonating sound it creates when the stone hits the wood, its soft touch, beautiful grain patterns, color, shine, and even fragrance; Our shin kaya comes from Tibetan spruce wood of the Yunnan province in southern China. Japanese Standard Size: The board measures 18.5 x 17.3 x 1.2 inches (47 x 44 x 3.1 centimeters) with Japanese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. The Way to Go: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go.'),
(1708, 'ymi:3862159235', 'Beechwood Veneer 0.4" Etched Beginner''s 9x9 Go Game Set Board with Single Convex Melamine Stones', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 26.13, 34, 5, 2.27, 25.0, 1.0, 23.5,
