 'Play, practice or teach Go on a traditional 2-Inch Bamboo Go Board set with reversible 19x19/13x13 grids. Includes full-sized double convex Yunzi stones. Reversible Go Board (Goban): 19x19 playing field on one side and 13x13 on the other; The 19x19 is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals and for quick games; The board measures 18.5 x 17.4 x 2 inches (47 x 44.2 x 5 centimeters) with Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. Bamboo Board: This board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time; Not only is bamboo beautiful, but it is also durable, environmentally friendly and sustainable; Wood grain may vary slightly from photos; A protective felt sleeve is included with the board. Double Convex Stones: Yunzi stones have been made for almost a thousand years from the Yunnan Province in southern China; They''re beautiful to look at, carry a nice heavy feel, and possess excellent ''snap'' qualities; Also, they are the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments; Each stone measures 9.2 x 21 millimeters (about 0.36 x 0.83 inch).'),
(1718, 'ymi:1374820466769', 'Bamboo 0.8" Go Board w/ Double Convex Yunzi Stones and Bowls Set', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 249.40, 0, 3, 7.72, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB001-A_YN-SB017-B", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "bamboo"}',
 'This striking Go board is made out of solid bamboo. It''s a very elegant way to play Go, combining the strength and beauty of bamboo - a grass species with the tensile strength of iron - with the timeless game of Go, a game so complicated that it''s been calculated there are more possible Go games than there are protons in the universe. This board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time. On the underside of this Chinese standard size 19x19 board is a 13x13 quick game board. This board is paired with a set of Yunzi professional Go stones, China''s finest. If you haven''t played with these stones before you''ll find it to be a completely different experience than playing with glass or plastic stones. Yunzi stones are beautiful to look at, carry a nice heavy feel, and possess excellent ''snap'' qualities. The stones will actually look nicer over time as they absorb moisture and natural oils from your fingertips. The Yunzi stones are matched with a pair of sturdy and elegant bamboo bowls. This set is made of environmentally friendly bamboo.'),
(1719, 'ymi:1374819680337', 'Yunzi Single Convex Go Game Stones and Bamboo Bowls Set - 21.5-22mm (Size 3)', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 137.60, 0, 5, 3.32, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-SB018-A", "stones": "yunzi"}',
 'This is a set of Yunzi professional Go stones, China''s finest. Yunzi stones are beautiful to look at, carry a nice heavy feel, and possess excellent ''snap'' qualities. The stones will actually look nicer over time as they absorb moisture and natural oils from your fingertips. Yunzi stones have been made for almost a thousand years in the same area of Yunnan Province in southern China. The secret recipe for making them is closely guarded, and nobody outside of Yunnan knows for sure what they''re made of - although rumor has it that the ingredients include agate and Yunnan mountain stone mixed with agate. To make sure that stones are genuine, hold them up to the light and you will see a greenish halo form around the edge. This is a unique characteristic of Yunzi. The Yunzi stones are matched with a pair of sturdy elegant bamboo bowls. 181 black and 180 white genuine Yunzi stones. 21.5-22mm (Size 3) single convex stones measure 5.6mm tall and 22mm wide (approximately 0.22" x 0.87"). Yunzi stones are the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments. Two bamboo bowls (gosu) that measure 5.9" x 3.9" (150mm x 100mm).'),
(1720, 'ymi:1374821122129', 'Bamboo 0.8" Etched Reversible 19x19 / 13x13 Go Game Set Board with 9.2mm Double Convex Yunzi Stones and Bamboo Wood Bowls Set', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 188.33, 19, 5, 8.62, 47.3, 2.0, 44.2,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB003-A_YN-SB017-B", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "bamboo", "variant_group": "ymi:go-sets-bamboo-0-8-etched-reversible-19x19-13x13", "variant": {"Stones": "Yunzi, double convex", "Bowls": "Bamboo"}}',
 'Play, practice or teach Go on a traditional 0.8-Inch etched Bamboo Go set with reversible 19x19/13x13 grids. Includes size 33 double convex Yunzi stones. Etched, Reversible Go Board (Goban): 19x19 playing field on one side and 13x13 on the other; The 19x19 is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals and for quick games; The beautifully etched board measures 18.6 x 17.4 x 0.8 inch (47.3 x 44.2 x 2 centimeters) with Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. Bamboo Board: This board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time; Not only is bamboo beautiful, but it is also durable, environmentally friendly and sustainable; Wood grain may vary slightly from photos; A protective felt sleeve is included with the board. Double Convex Stones: Yunzi stones have been made for almost a thousand years from the Yunnan Province in southern China; They''re beautiful to look at, carry a nice heavy feel, and possess excellent ''snap'' qualities; They''re also the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments; Each stone measures 9.2 x 21 millimeters (about 0.36 x 0.83 inch).'),
(1721, 'ymi:1374821187665', 'Bamboo 0.8" Etched Reversible 19x19/13x13 Go Game Set Board with Single Convex Yunzi Stones and Bamboo Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 172.00, 0, 4, 7.75, 47.3, 2.0, 44.2,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB003-A_YN-SB018-A", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "bamboo", "variant_group": "ymi:go-sets-bamboo-0-8-etched-reversible-19x19-13x13", "variant": {"Stones": "Yunzi, single convex", "Bowls": "Bamboo"}}',
 'Enjoy an expert game of Go with this beautifully etched Bamboo Go board, a set of traditional black and white Yunzi stones, and bamboo bowls. HIGH-QUALITY GO GAME SET (BAMBOO): This durable, sustainable set comes with a sturdy and beautiful board measuring 18.6 x 17.4 x 0.8 inches (47.3 x 44.2 x 2 centimeters). PLAY BOTH LONG AND SHORT GAMES: This board comes with 19x19 and 13x13 etched playing fields; The 19x19 side is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning the basics and for quick games. SOLID SINGLE CONVEX YUNZI STONES: This set comes with 181 black and 180 white size 3 Yunzi stones; Single-convex stones produce a louder ''snap'' from the flat side when played on the board and can be flipped over for playing out variations when reviewing a game; Each stone measures 5.7 x 22 millimeters (about 0.22 x 0.86 inch). PROFESSIONAL GRADE: Yunzi stones are the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments. WE''VE GOT YOU COVERED: With everything ready, including bamboo bowls, bowl securing straps, bowl carrying case, felt board sleeve and the instruction booklet, "The Way to Go", by Karl Baker, you''re ready to "Go"!.'),
(1722, 'ymi:1374835146833', 'Bamboo 0.8" Reversible 19x19 / 13x13 Go Game Set Board with Single Convex Melamine Stones and Bamboo Wood Bowls Set', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 110.93, 28, 3, 7.26, 47.3, 2.0, 44.2,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TB001-A_YN-SB028-A", "stones": "melamine", "wood": "bamboo", "variant_group": "ymi:go-sets-bamboo-0-8-reversible-19x19-13x13", "variant": {"Stones": "Melamine, single convex", "Bowls": "Bamboo"}}',
 'Play, study or teach Go on a traditional 0.8-Inch Bamboo Go set with reversible 19x19/13x13 grids. Includes bowls and single convex melamine stones. Reversible Go Board (Goban): 19x19 playing field on one side and 13x13 on the other; The 19x19 is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals and for quick games; The board measures 18.6 x 17.4 x 0.8 inch (47.3 x 44.2 x 2 centimeters) with Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. Bamboo Board: This board is made of solid strips of bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time; Not only is bamboo beautiful, but it is also durable, environmentally friendly and sustainable; Wood grain may vary slightly from photos; A protective felt sleeve is included with the board. Melamine Stones: 181 black and 180 white 22-millimeter (Size 3) single convex stones included; Each stone measures 5.7 x 22-millimeter (approximately 0.22 x 0.86 inch).'),
(1723, 'ymi:2537616113745', 'Double Convex Korean Glass Paduk Go Stones with Jujube Wood "Gosu" Go Game Bowls', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 81.70, 0, 4, 3.15, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-SB029-A", "stones": "Korean glass"}',
 'This is an elegant set of choice for your favorite Go play. The set comes with elegant Kitani shaped bowls that are made from the durable jujube or also known as Chinese Date Wood. It is a very hard and strong wood material. The Korean double convex go stones are made of hardened glass and approximately measure 0.9" x 0.4" (22mm x 9.5mm). The handy carrying case will protect the stones and bowls as you easily transport them from place to place. Please note: Go Board is not included in the set.  Double Convex Korean Hardened Glass Go Stones "Jangstone": Made by renowned Korean Go stone manufacturer, these perfectly shaped stones have excellent weight and a beautiful hardened glass luster. Go stones comes with two colors, with black that measures 22 x 9.5 millimeters and white that measures 22 x 9.3 millimeters. Jujube Wood Go Bowls, "Gosu": The set comes with elegant Kitani shaped bowls that are made from the durable jujube or also known as Chinese Date Wood. The bowls measure 5.9 x 5.9 x 4.3 inches (15 x 15 x 10.8 cm).'),
(1724, 'ymi:2433272610897', 'Double Convex Korean Hardened Glass Paduk Go Stones with Bamboo, "Gosu" Go Game Bowls - Size 33 (9.3mm) Stones', 'go-stones', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 61.92, 0, 4, 3.49, 14.8, 10.9, 14.8,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-SB030-A", "stones": "Korean glass"}',
 'An elegant choice for an intermediate set of Go stones and bowls. The double convex go stones are made of Korean glass, known for having solid heft. Solid Double Convex Go Stones, "Jangstone": This set comes with size 33 stones made by renowned Korean Go stone manufacturer; 181 black stones measure 9.5 x 22 millimeters each and 180 white stones measure 9.3 x 22 millimeters; Can be played with Chinese or Japanese standard size board. Sturdy Bamboo Go Bowls, "Gosu": The Korean Go stones are complemented by natural bamboo bowls that measure 5.83 x 5.83 x 4.3 inches (14.8 x 14.8 x 10.9 centimeters). Complete Set: The set comes with bowl securing straps and a carrying bag for easy transport and storage. The Way to Go: Included is Karl Baker''s beginner classic booklet explaining the essential rules and strategies of Go. Go Board is not included in the set.'),
(1725, 'ymi:2537618276433', 'Bamboo 2" Reversible 19x19/13x13 Go Game Set Board with Double Convex Korean Hardened Glass Paduk Go Stones and Jujube Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 146.18, 0, 3, 11.32, 47.0, 5.0, 44.2,
