 'Build and conquer territories in a game of Go with this etched reversible bamboo Go board set, double convex stones, and wooden bowls. Reversible Go Board (Goban): This board comes with 19x19 and 13x13 playing fields etched into the wood; The 19x19 is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals and for quick games. Bamboo Board: This board is made of solid strips of durable bamboo, pressed together one layer at a time; Wood grain may vary slightly from photos; A protective felt sleeve is included with the board; The board measures 18.6 x 17.4 x 0.8 inch (47.3 x 44.2 x 2 centimeters) with Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. Solid Double Convex Size 33 Korean Hardened Glass "Jangstone": This set comes with 181 black stones (9.5 x 22 millimeters) and 180 white stones (9.3 x 22 millimeters). Set of 2 Jujube Bowls: Our jujube date wood bowls are hollowed out from a single piece of Chinese date wood, naturally colored to a dark amber shade, and finished by hand to a medium gloss; Each bowl measures 5.9 x 4.3 inches (15 x 10.8 centimeters); Bowl straps and a carrying bag are included.'),
(1730, 'ymi:2791601176657', 'Dark Cherry Veneer 0.6" Reversible Go Game Set Board with Double Convex Melamine Stones & Jujube Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 104.92, 0, 5, 5.99, 48.0, 1.5, 45.1,
