 'Get immersed in the classic "control and capture" game of Go on this 19x19/13x13 wooden board set with melamine stones, and jujube bowls. REVERSIBLE GO BOARD (GOBAN): 19x19 playing field on one side and 13x13 on the other; The 19x19 is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals and for quick games; The elegant, rich dark Cherry veneer board measures 18.9 x 17.76 x 0.6 inch (48 x 45.1 x 1.5 centimeters) with Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. DOUBLE CONVEX STONES: Melamine is an exceptionally durable compound; These are excellent stones to use in an environment where the stones will be put to constant, hard use; They have a satisfying heft and snap to them; Includes 181 black and 180 white Size 32 stones, each measuring 9 x 22-millimeter (approximately 0.36 x 0.87 inch). SET OF 2 WILD JUJUBE BOWLS: Also known as Chinese date wood, jujube is a hard and sturdy species; Each deep, natural grained bowl measures 5.7 x 3.5 inches (14.6 x 9 centimeters); Securing bowl straps and a vinyl carrying case are also included.'),
(1731, 'ymi:3262738104401', 'Shin Kaya 2" Reversible 19x19 / 13x13 Go Game Set Board with 9.2mm Double Convex Yunzi Stones and Jujube Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 197.80, 0, 3, 20.41, 47.0, 5.0, 44.0,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "YN-TS001-A_YN-SB001-A", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "shin kaya"}',
 'Experience the beauty and precision of our traditional Shin Kaya Go set. With its 2-inch thick board, this set is reversible for 19x19 or 13x13 gameplay, allowing you to customize your experience. Complete with size 33 double convex Yunzi stones, this set is a must-have for any Go enthusiast looking for the perfect combination of elegance and function. Reversible Go Board (Goban): Our board features a reversible design with a 19x19 playing field on one side and a 13x13 on the other, offering versatility and flexibility for players of all skill levels; The 19x19 is perfect for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals or for quick games; The board measures 18.5 x 17.3 x 2 inches (47 x 44 x 5 centimeters) and features Japanese standard size grids of 21.5 x 23 millimeters, providing a perfect playing surface.'),
(1732, 'ymi:3265317666897', 'Dark Cherry Veneer 0.6" Reversible Go Game Set Board with Single Convex Yunzi Stones and Jujube Bowls', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 236.50, 0, 3, 21.32, 48.0, 1.5, 45.1,
