 'Immerse yourself in a strategy game played for over two millennia! Play the battle of wits and territory on this handsome Go game set. REVERSIBLE GO BOARD (GOBAN): 19x19 playing field on one side and 13x13 on the other; The 19x19 side is for standard gameplay, while the 13x13 is great for learning rules and fundamentals and for quick games; This elegant, rich dark Cherry veneer board measures 18.9 x 17.76 x 0.6 inch (48 x 45.1 x 1.5 centimeters) with Chinese standard size grids of 22 x 23.5 millimeters. YUNZI GO STONES: This set comes with 181 black and 180 white Yunzi stones; Single-convex stones produce a louder ''snap'' from the flat side when played on the board and can be flipped over for playing out variations when reviewing a game. PROFESSIONAL GRADE: Yunzi stones are the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments; The Size 3 Go stones measure 5.7 x 22 millimeters (about 0.22 x 0.86 inch) in diameter.'),
(1733, 'ymi:3265320452177', 'Mahogany 0.4" Inlaid Go Board w/ Single Convex Yunzi Stones Set', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 156.52, 0, 5, 8.9, NULL, NULL, NULL,
 '{"supplier": "Yellow Mountain Imports", "supplier_sku": "US-FB002-A_YN-SY012-A", "stones": "yunzi", "wood": "mahogany"}',
 'Solid mahogany Go floor board with a Chinese design and Ming style curves. This classically elegant board features inlaid lines and star points. One large drawer opens on both ends for storage of stones. Paired with single convex Yunzi, the preferred stones of China. One 0.4" (10mm) thick mahogany solid wood floor board (goban), 5.8" (145mm) high with legs included. Board is Chinese standard size (23mm x 24mm grids) and measures 20.9" x 18.9" x 0.4" (53cm x 48cm x 1cm). Inlaid playing field is 19x19. One large drawer opens on both ends for storage of stones. 181 black and 180 white genuine Yunzi stones. 21.5-22mm (Size 3) single convex stones measure 5.6mm tall and 21.5mm wide (approximately 0.22" x 0.87"); Yunzi stones are the official stones of all professional Chinese Weiqi (Go) tournaments. Booklet on how to play go, "The Way to Go", by Karl Baker.'),
(1734, 'ymi:4414128586833', 'Bamboo 0.8" Etched Reversible 19x19 / 13x13 Go Game Set Board with Single Convex Melamine Stones and Bamboo Bowls Set', 'go-sets', 'yellow-mountain-imports', 60.19, 0, 5, 7.26, 47.0, 2.0, 44.0,
