 '{"supplier": "American-Wholesaler (GammonVillage)", "supplier_sku": "3230", "board_size_in": 21, "variant_group": "american-wholesaler:tournament-tournament-backgammon-set-wycliffe-brothers", "variant": {"Colour": "Orange Field"}}',
